ZLWarm for WebCLAP (ports/zl-warm):

- PluginProcessor.cpp: ZL_WEBCLAP_HEADLESS builds the processor without its editor (module.wasm)
- panel/logo_panel.cpp, PluginEditor.h, under ZL_WEBCLAP: one style, the default (dark), whatever ui_style holds; a
  double click on the logo no longer switches it, and the editor no longer listens to ui_style
- PluginEditor.cpp: not resizable, no resize corner (the page shows the editor at its size)

